# Per-participant harness dirs you create by hand per WORKSHOP_GUIDE.md -- the
# AgentCore CLI derives a harness's config directory from its registry name,
# not a separate path, so a uniquely-named harness needs its own directory.
# Neither agentcore/ nor app/ is tracked at all on this branch -- you create
# both from scratch (see WORKSHOP_GUIDE.md's Phase 0) -- these patterns just
# stop your own local copies from being accidentally committed if you fork
# this branch and start tracking your work.
agentcore/
app/investorAgent_*/
app/brokerAgent_*/

# Local prep material (decks, PDFs, reference images) for building the
# workshop presentation -- not workshop content itself, not for participants.
prep/
